  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception capabilities, separating motion commands from sensor outcomes. The specification binds each perception outcome to a single safe, progress-oriented action, ensuring safety (no collisions) and steady exploration. Recovery states are conservative but return to exploration quickly when possible. Rotations are used to bias coverage, and full_rotate is reserved for repeated or severe blockage. All uncontrollable events are handled in every state, and only one controllable is enabled per non-terminal state.",
